        <p>Ran the product design program for four years. Wrote the curriculum, taught it, critiqued a lot of work, and placed the people who came through it at startups.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-head"><span class="job-co">Before that</span><span class="job-role">Appiphony, Piasa Games, Big Lobby</span><span class="job-when">2010 &ndash; 2015</span></div>
